 "_comment": [
  "Per-file decisions for the [MT] library (github.com/musetrainer/library).",
  "The repository makes a single blanket 'Public Domain' claim with no LICENSE",
  "file and no per-file terms, so each file is judged here on its own:",
  "docs/03-content-pipeline.md §1 requires the *composition* to be US public",
  "domain and the *edition* to be redistributable, and a blanket claim can only",
  "answer the second question. 'exclude' entries state why, and are reported by",
  "tools/content/import_musetrainer.py.",
  "Levels are stage.unit (docs/02): stage 4 ~ ABRSM 1, 5 ~ 2-3, 6 ~ 4-5, 7 ~ 6,",
  "8 ~ 7-8, 9 = beyond grades. Edit this file to re-level a piece; nothing here",
  "is derived from the audio or the notation."
